# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads for the runner image (deploy/service/Dockerfile): the package, its config and
# the library's text files. Film projects, caches, media and the git history stay out (gigabytes).
.git
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
.pytest_cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
projects/*
!projects/_template/
cache/
docs/
tests/
deploy/lipsync/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.mov
*.jsonl
*.html
!src/nraiorbit/ui/templates/*.html
